  "requested": "Machan, Nov 12 2026 10:01–10:06 PM ICT, his words: \"now that we separated it into sections, we should fill the space the section gives us. we have wasted space in every section now\"; \"we want to keep the same info, we can just show more of it\"; \"in what we take care of, we can have bigger tiles\" / \"with longer list\"; \"don't go beyond the size of the screen but use the space\"; \"each section could be optimized for space\"; \"Catch Small Problems Early\" becomes \"Home Care, On Schedule\"; remove \"See What's Included\" from the plan tiles, since \"See What We Take Care Of\" sits just below them. Top priority deck, ahead of the other funnel improvement decks. Four cards, one per Home section, A vs B on how big and how long. Real screenshots of the live four-section Home at 390 and 1280. Notes and Machan Decides on every card.",
